    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "EFFECTIVE APRIL 25th,\n1953\nAll previous issues cancelled\nBCPA\nDC-6 Sleeper Service\nSCHEDULES\nFARES\nAIR CARGO RATES\nEXCESS BAGGAGE RATES\nCANADA - USA - HAWAII - FIJI\nAUSTRALIA - NEW ZEALAND\n*\nBritish Commonwealth\nPacific Airlines Ltd.\nAll information contained herein subject to change\nwithout notice.\nINFORMATION",
